{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu23", "cards": [{"id": "u2.t.divergent-evolution", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">di<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">VER<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gent<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">ev<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"divergent evolution\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: divergent evolution\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"divergent evolution\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"30\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"30\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species A<\/text><text x=\"160\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species B<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">common ancestor<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Related groups become more different over time as they adapt to different conditions.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>趋异演化<\/b>：亲缘相近的类群因适应不同条件而变得越来越不同。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">di- = apart. Same ancestor, different paths.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">di- = 分开：同一祖先，不同路径。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Do the arm of a human and the wing of a bat show divergent or convergent evolution?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Divergent. They came from a common ancestor.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.coevolution", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">co<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ev<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"coevolution\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: coevolution\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"coevolution\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"38\"/><polygon points=\"149.0,36.3 137.8,35.3 143.0,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"138.7,90.0 144.6,80.5 149.9,89.0\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"51.0,83.7 62.2,84.7 57.0,93.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"61.3,30.0 55.4,39.5 50.1,31.0\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"8\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"20.2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Deeper<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"29.4\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">flowers<\/text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"46\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Longer<\/text><text x=\"162\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tongues<\/text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"84\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"100.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Deeper still<\/text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"46\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Longer still<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Two species evolve in response to each other, over many generations.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>协同演化<\/b>：两个物种在长期相互作用中彼此推动着演化。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">co- = together. Evolve together.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">co- = 共同。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Give an example of coevolution.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Flowers and their pollinators, or predators and prey.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.extinction", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ex<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TINC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"extinction\" data-audio=\"audio/extinction.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: extinction\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"extinction\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f1\"/><ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f1 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"165\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f1 d\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">alive<\/text><text x=\"110\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gone<\/text><text x=\"165\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gone<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">last individual dies<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The complete disappearance of a species.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>灭绝<\/b>：一个物种彻底消失。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ex- = out. Put out like a flame.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">ex- = 出：像火焰熄灭。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is extinction?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The complete disappearance of a species.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.mass-extinction", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">MASS<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">ex<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TINC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mass extinction\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: mass extinction\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mass extinction\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"100\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"20\" class=\"\"/><path d=\"M25 30 L70 32 L100 90 L130 50 L175 85\" class=\"f6 s\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species through time<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">sharp drop = mass extinction<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A short period in Earth history when a large share of all species die out.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>大灭绝<\/b>：地球历史上很短的一段时间里，大量物种同时消失。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Mass = a very large number at once. The dinosaurs went in one.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">mass = 大批量，一次性。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a mass extinction.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The end-Cretaceous extinction about 66 million years ago, which ended the non-bird dinosaurs.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.artificial-selection", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ar<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ti<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">FI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cial<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">se<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LEC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"artificial selection\" data-audio=\"audio/artificial-selection.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: artificial selection\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"artificial selection\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"44.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Pick the<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"53.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plants<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">with the<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">sweetest<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"81.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fruit<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Breed<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">them<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"53.925\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sweeter<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"62.625\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fruit over<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"71.325\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">generations<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">People choose which organisms breed, to make traits they want more common.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>人工选择<\/b>：人类挑选哪些个体繁殖，使想要的性状越来越常见。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">artificial = made by people. Humans do the selecting.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">artificial = 人造的：由人来选。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How is artificial selection different from natural selection?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">People, not the environment, choose which individuals breed.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.genetic-modification", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ge<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">NET<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">mod<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">fi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"genetic modification\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: genetic modification\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"genetic modification\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Find a<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">useful<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gene<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Insert it<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">into the<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">organism&#x27;s<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"76.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Organism<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">makes<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">the new<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">trait<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Changing an organism&#x27;s DNA directly, for example by adding a gene from another species.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>基因修饰（转基因）<\/b>：直接改变生物的 DNA，例如加入另一物种的基因。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">modify = change. Genetic modification = change the genes on purpose.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">modify = 改变；基因改造 = 有目的地改基因。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How is genetic modification different from selective breeding?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It changes DNA directly instead of choosing who breeds.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.genetic-drift", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ge<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">NET<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span> <span class=\"st\">DRIFT<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"genetic drift\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: genetic drift\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"genetic drift\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><line x1=\"95.0\" y1=\"45.0\" x2=\"115.0\" y2=\"45.0\"/><polygon points=\"115.0,45.0 110.5,47.2 110.5,42.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">by chance, not by fitness<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">blue allele rose from 50% to 80%<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Random change in allele frequencies from one generation to the next, strongest in small populations.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>遗传漂变<\/b>：等位基因频率在代际之间的随机变化，在小种群中最明显。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Drift = a boat carried by chance, not steered.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">drift = 随波漂流：靠运气，不是靠适应。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is genetic drift caused by fitness?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It is random chance.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.gene-flow", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GENE<\/span> <span class=\"st\">FLOW<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"gene flow\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: gene flow\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"gene flow\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"45\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"32\" class=\"f1\"/><ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"32\" class=\"f2\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"50.0\" x2=\"115.0\" y2=\"50.0\"/><polygon points=\"115.0,50.0 110.5,52.2 110.5,47.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"115.0\" y1=\"62.0\" x2=\"85.0\" y2=\"62.0\"/><polygon points=\"85.0,62.0 89.5,59.8 89.5,64.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">migrants carry alleles<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The movement of alleles from one population to another when individuals migrate and breed.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>基因流<\/b>：个体迁移并繁殖后，等位基因在种群之间的转移。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">flow = move. Alleles flow like water between populations.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基因像水一样在种群间流动。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What effect does gene flow have on two populations?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It makes them more alike.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.bottleneck-effect", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">BOT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tle<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">neck<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">ef<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">FECT<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"bottleneck effect\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: bottleneck effect\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"bottleneck effect\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" class=\"f5\"/><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" class=\"f6\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" class=\"f1\"/><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"125.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"125.0,60.0 120.5,62.2 120.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"62\" r=\"5\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">few survive, less variety<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A sharp fall in population size that leaves a smaller, less varied gene pool.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>瓶颈效应<\/b>：种群数量骤减，使基因库变小、变异减少。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A bottle&#x27;s narrow neck lets only a few through.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">瓶颈窄，只有少数能通过。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What happens to genetic variation after a bottleneck?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It is reduced.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.founder-effect", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">FOUND<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">er<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">ef<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">FECT<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"founder effect\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: founder effect\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"founder effect\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"45\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"35\" class=\"f1 d\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"45\" r=\"5\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" class=\"f4\"/><line x1=\"88.0\" y1=\"55.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"55.0\"/><polygon points=\"120.0,55.0 115.5,57.2 115.5,52.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"25\" class=\"f1 d\"/><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">a few settlers start a new population<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A new population started by a few individuals has only a small sample of the original alleles.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>奠基者效应<\/b>：少数个体建立的新种群，只带有原种群等位基因的一小部分。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">founder = the person who starts something.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">founder = 创始者。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: A few birds blown to an island start a new population. Which effect is this?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The founder effect.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u2.t.divergent-evolution", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Related groups become more different over time as they adapt to different conditions.”<\/i>", "opts": ["adaptive radiation", "allele", "divergent evolution", "adaptation"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>divergent evolution<\/b>: Related groups become more different over time as they adapt to different conditions. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">趋异演化<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.coevolution", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Two species evolve in response to each other, over many generations.”<\/i>", "opts": ["allele", "homologous structure", "mass extinction", "coevolution"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>coevolution<\/b>: Two species evolve in response to each other, over many generations. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">协同演化<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.extinction", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The complete disappearance of a species.”<\/i>", "opts": ["comparative embryology", "adaptive radiation", "extinction", "genetic drift"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>extinction<\/b>: The complete disappearance of a species. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">灭绝<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.mass-extinction", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A short period in Earth history when a large share of all species die out.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mutation", "adaptation", "analogous structure", "mass extinction"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mass extinction<\/b>: A short period in Earth history when a large share of all species die out. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">大灭绝<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.artificial-selection", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“People choose which organisms breed, to make traits they want more common.”<\/i>", "opts": ["gene flow", "divergent evolution", "competition", "artificial selection"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>artificial selection<\/b>: People choose which organisms breed, to make traits they want more common. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人工选择<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.genetic-modification", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Changing an organism&#x27;s DNA directly, for example by adding a gene from another species.”<\/i>", "opts": ["genetic modification", "microevolution", "divergent evolution", "antibiotic resistance"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>genetic modification<\/b>: Changing an organism&#x27;s DNA directly, for example by adding a gene from another species. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基因修饰（转基因）<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.genetic-drift", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Random change in allele frequencies from one generation to the next, strongest in small populations.”<\/i>", "opts": ["allele frequency", "gene flow", "genetic drift", "mutation"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>genetic drift<\/b>: Random change in allele frequencies from one generation to the next, strongest in small populations. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">遗传漂变<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.gene-flow", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The movement of alleles from one population to another when individuals migrate and breed.”<\/i>", "opts": ["gene flow", "macroevolution", "genetic modification", "adaptive radiation"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>gene flow<\/b>: The movement of alleles from one population to another when individuals migrate and breed. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基因流<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.bottleneck-effect", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A sharp fall in population size that leaves a smaller, less varied gene pool.”<\/i>", "opts": ["competition", "founder effect", "bottleneck effect", "allele frequency"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>bottleneck effect<\/b>: A sharp fall in population size that leaves a smaller, less varied gene pool. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">瓶颈效应<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.founder-effect", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A new population started by a few individuals has only a small sample of the original alleles.”<\/i>", "opts": ["variation", "mass extinction", "founder effect", "adaptive radiation"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>founder effect<\/b>: A new population started by a few individuals has only a small sample of the original alleles. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">奠基者效应<\/span>", "whys": null}]}